# Intake

`intake/QUEUE.md` is the outer-loop pile. Each item needs a goal, a done-means, a source, and a playbook hint.

Do not start work from a row that is still `inbox`. Promote to `ready` only when done-means is checkable. One owner per ready item. Never two agents on the same row without a worktree split.

After a run, move the row to `done` or `blocked` with an evidence pointer (PR URL, log path, or decision-log time).
